### Case: one-customer — a single customer record through the gateway.
###
### Expect 200 with the five security headers, each once, with the configured
### value; no X-Powered-By, Server, Via, X-AspNet-Version or X-AspNetMvc-Version;
### an X-Request-Id. The body is byte-identical to backend-direct.http's.
GET {{GATEWAY}}/users/1
accept: application/json
